            ("Ubiquitin-dependent degradation after endoplasmic-reticulum retention", "Correct. Phe508del causes misfolding, retention by endoplasmic-reticulum quality control, and proteasomal degradation before much protein reaches the apical membrane."),
            ("Reduced chloride conductance through normally trafficked channels", "A conductance mutation impairs ion passage through surface channels. It does not primarily prevent the protein from reaching the membrane."),
